" end="00:37.500">, </span><span begin="00:37.500" end="00:37.800">arms </span><span begin="00:37.800" end="00:38.040">flying </span><span begin="00:38.040" end="00:38.520">everywhere </span><span begin="00:38.520" end="00:38.730">and</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.730" end="00:39.900"><span begin="00:38.730" end="00:39.090">Bottles </span><span begin="00:39.090" end="00:39.450">aswell </span><span begin="00:39.450" end="00:39.630">it's </span><span begin="00:39.630" end="00:39.900">just</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.900" end="00:41.040"><span begin="00:39.900" end="00:40.260">Something </span><span begin="00:40.260" end="00:40.380">to </span><span begin="00:40.380" end="00:40.710">talk </span><span begin="00:40.710" end="00:41.040">about</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.040" end="00:42.120"><span begin="00:41.040" end="00:41.100">A </span><span begin="00:41.100" end="00:41.550">story </span><span begin="00:41.550" end="00:41.670">to </span><span begin="00:41.670" end="00:42.000">tell </span><span begin="00:42.000" end="00:42.120">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.790" end="00:48.750"><span begin="00:44.790" end="00:45.240">Well </span><span begin="00:45.240" end="00:45.300">I'm </span><span begin="00:45.300" end="00:45.450">so </span><span begin="00:45.450" end="00:45.690">glad </span><span begin="00:45.690" end="00:45.780">they </span><span begin="00:45.780" end="00:46.050">turned </span><span begin="00:46.050" end="00:46.200">us </span><span begin="00:46.200" end="00:46.410">all </span><span begin="00:46.410" end="00:46.620">away </span><span begin="00:46.620" end="00:46.740">we'll </span><span begin="00:46.740" end="00:46.980">put </span><span begin="00:46.980" end="00:47.100">it </span><span begin="00:47.100" end="00:47.490">down </span><span begin="00:47.490" end="00:47.730">to </span><span begin="00:47.730" end="00:48.750">fate</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.070" end="00:54.120"><span begin="00:50.070" end="00